><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relationship between number of sexual intercourse partners and selected health risk behaviors among public high school adolescents</article-title><source>J Adolesc Health</source><year>1999</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>328</fpage><lpage>35</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10551663</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1054-139X(99)00051-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gordon</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Mwale</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Preventing HIV with Young People: A Case Study from Zambia</article-title><source>Reprod Health Matters</source><year>2006</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>68</fpage><lpage>79</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17101424</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0968-8080(06)28266-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reddy</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Resnicow</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Omardien</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kambaran</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence and correlates of substance use among high school students in South Africa and the United States</article-title><source>Am J Public Health</source><year>2007</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>1859</fpage><lpage>64</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17761580</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2105/AJPH.2006.086330</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Delva</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wallace</surname><given-names>JM</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>O'Malley</